  "description": "<p>This personalized area rug brings the excitement of the racetrack to any space with its vibrant design. Featuring a detailed checkered flag pattern and a lifelike race track, this rug can be customized with a name or word for a personal touch. It is designed to add energy and action, perfect for fans of motorsports.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Customizable with a personal name or word for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Features an exciting checkered flag and race track design.</li>\n<li>Soft yet durable polyester surface provides comfort.</li>\n<li>Non-slip rubber backing offers confident grip and stability.</li>\n<li>Versatile for various spaces and can layer over existing floor mats.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Game Room, Garage, Kid’s Space, Patio, Entry, Living Space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Checkered</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Motorsports, Race Car</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This rug is suitable for game rooms, garages, kid’s spaces, patios, entryways, or living areas. Its durable construction makes it ideal for high-traffic zones and both indoor and outdoor settings.</p>",
